        Task: Conduct smoke tests
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Support hot fix testing (was Support hot fix)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Support warranty testing (was support warranty)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Work Product:&amp;nbsp;Hot Fix Approval
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
