&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Automated vs. Manual Test Execution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop test cases
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop test execution schedule
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Verify test environment setup
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;October 2015:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Fixed grammatical and&amp;nbsp;style errors&amp;nbsp;in the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop test cases
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop test data requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Map requirements to tests
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Specify test environment
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop test execution schedule
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop integration test execution schedule
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Prepare and load test data
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Verify system test environment setup
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify business users to support UAT testing
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Train business users for user acceptance tests
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Agree work-arounds and mitigations plans for outstanding UAT defects
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Fixed grammatical and style errors in the following activities:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Prepare for User Acceptance Testing
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - Integrated MPT test content and created specialized activities and tasks for
    integration, system integration, user acceptance testing.
